Financial Services for DeepSeek Harness

This is an independent, out-of-tree adaptation project. It is not an official
Anthropic or DeepSeek financial product.

The bundled Agent prompts and Skills are limited to three selected Financial
Analysis / Equity Research Agents, their nine owned Workers, and 22 Skills from
the corresponding upstream vertical-plugin directories. Their selected source
origins are recorded in assets/runtime-manifest.json. The full historical
catalogue and source archive are intentionally not included.

The original financial-services source is licensed under Apache License 2.0.
No commercial market data, credentials, or Microsoft tenant grants are included
or implied. Business execution is not represented as verified by asset
inclusion. Missing upstream binary templates are not invented or claimed to be
included.

DSH runtime packages and Zod retain their respective MIT licenses. They are
installation dependencies, not code copied into this project's Client artifact.
The Client uses the Harness shell's shared React and Zod runtimes.
